            </map>
            <map to='#8c5b43'>
              <bucket>&quot;(BRU) Betty Brunsvick--Her residence was plundered in early 1941. Contents were selectively removed to the Louvre and Jeu de Paume for processing.  The remainder was assessed at the time of the Aryanization of her building rue Scheffer in late 1942.&quot;</bucket>
            </map>
            <map to='#8c5b43'>
              <bucket>&quot;(CSA/CSB) Saglio&quot;</bucket>
