            <map to='#8c5b43'>
              <bucket>&quot;(Rosenberg-Aronstein) Schaerbeek-Bruxelles, Belgique-The building where Mr. Rosenberg and Mrs. Aronstein lived was once occupied by members of the Gestapo who allegedly removed their property on 2 March 1943.&quot;</bucket>
            </map>
