            </map>
            <map to='#a1887f'>
              <bucket>&quot;(MmeBKats) Schaerbeek-Bruxelles, Belgique-German authorities seized Ms. Kats&apos;s belongings on 30 April 1943 and on 3 May 1943&quot;</bucket>
